{"unit_id":"bearice__dsh-keep-awake#card-zh","repo":"bearice/dsh-keep-awake","commit":"e713301ec51803c3b6f827f2b80754be82a0e694","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Keep Awake 防休眠（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 agent 或后台任务运行时让电脑保持唤醒。它通过扫描运行中的 agent、后台 job 和可选的待执行定时任务，按需启动系统辅助进程，并在活动结束后经过可配置宽限期释放。主要功能包括显示活动与唤醒状态、手动保持、选择是否阻止屏幕关闭、设置定时任务保温和实时修改偏好。适合希望 DSH 长任务运行期间电脑不进入休眠的用户。需要 Node.js 22 以上；按平台使用 PowerShell、caffeinate 或 systemd-inhibit，不需要 API key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:633-744","lib/index.js:465-525","lib/client.js:281-410"]}
{"unit_id":"bearice__dsh-keep-awake#card-en","repo":"bearice/dsh-keep-awake","commit":"e713301ec51803c3b6f827f2b80754be82a0e694","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Keep Awake 防休眠 is a DSH web plugin that keeps the computer awake during agent or background jobs, optionally scheduled tasks. It releases after a grace period. The web panel shows activity and offers manual hold and display settings. Requires Node.js 22+; PowerShell, caffeinate, or systemd-inhibit.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:633-744","lib/index.js:465-525","lib/client.js:281-410"]}
