{"unit_id":"bearice__dsh-keep-awake#feature-1","repo":"bearice/dsh-keep-awake","commit":"e713301ec51803c3b6f827f2b80754be82a0e694","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Keep Awake 防休眠 的功能「按活动状态保持唤醒」：检测运行中的 agent 与后台 job，并在需要时启动平台辅助进程。活动结束后按设置的宽限期释放唤醒状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:633-744","lib/index.js:465-492"]}
